#: ../../source/reference/toolbutton.rst:13
msgid ""
"The ToolButton class provides a UI component with a button-like "
"appearance and an associated popup menu. It extends the functionality of "
"AbstractButton to handle menu-related features. Users can show and hide "
"the menu associated with the ToolButton, and the class also provides "
"functionality to update the button text based on menu selections."
msgstr ""

